sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Usuário
  participant N as Navegador (Turbo)
  participant C as UserStoryMovesController
  participant A as Authentication / ProjectScoped
  participant M as UserStory (Active Record)
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  U->>N: escolhe "Mover para: Sprint 1"
  N->>C: POST /projects/1/user_stories/7/move
  C->>A: require_authentication
  A->>D: busca Session pelo cookie assinado
  A->>D: Current.user.projects.find(1)
  Note over A,D: projeto de outro usuário → 404
  C->>D: @project.user_stories.find(7)
  C->>D: @project.backlogs.find(backlog_id)
  Note over C,D: backlog de outro projeto → 404
  C->>M: update!(backlog:)
  M->>M: validações (mesmo projeto)
  M->>D: UPDATE (FK composta project_id, backlog_id)
  C-->>N: 303 redirect + flash
  N->>C: GET /projects/1/user_stories/7
  C-->>N: HTML da história
  N-->>U: página atualizada sem recarregar o layout
